    <string name="welcome">Type a word, in any language, to see its entry in the English Wiktionary. You can also select a word in another app and choose “Look up in Wiktionary”.\n\nThis app is not affiliated with Wiktionary, Wikipedia or the Wikimedia Foundation.</string>
