    <string name="about_text">A small app for reading the English Wiktionary.\n\nBy Nicolas Vaughan (nicolasvaughan@proton.me), 2026. Free software, under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later.\n\nThe entries come from Wiktionary and its contributors, under the CC BY-SA 4.0 licence; the app only shows them.\n\nThe author has no association whatsoever with Wiktionary, Wikipedia or the Wikimedia Foundation, which runs them. This is not an official app of any of them, and they do not endorse it. Wiktionary and Wikipedia are trademarks of the Wikimedia Foundation.</string>
